{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの雨で湿気がすごくて、前髪がぺたんこです(･_･、)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝からまた、お母さんから写真が届きました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4VEN77YEYFSCTYWEZ8884","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nほんとにかわいいなあ。\n桜が似合う(♡˙︶˙♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体が弱いわんこ なので風邪をひきやすいです。\n年中のときから、ずっと一緒です!\n妹のような存在(´-`).｡oO\n泣いていると心配して近寄っきてくれます。\nとてもいこです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"        ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はウサギ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4VFPRWJ6PWFTJ7SPZ1HSC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、動物シリーズです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ動物のネタがきれてきました･･･。\nアライグマとかやりたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛をゆうとすごく楽なのですが、丸顔がばれてしまうのが欠点。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウサギといえば、ミスバニーのキーホルダーをりかちゃんとおそろいでもっています。\nりかちゃんは水色で、私はピンク!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボールペンもおそろいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リラックマケーキ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4VGQA9DWWKB46VS5JFZR2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クマの2人。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4VHNMZHGFC0BY7N2AB0Z9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nがおー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日頑張りましょう☆*。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}